row ~ integrations/amqp/v4.maxDelayBuckets ~ class K: the reason row of the delay buckets, no field (C4)
row ~ integrations/bunorm/migrate/v4.printAppliedGroup ~ W-9: db:migrate refuses while a ran-but-not-recorded marker stands, door --force (C8)
row ~ integrations/bunorm/v4.SplitterConfig ~ M-13: SplitterConfig.PrimaryFallbackDisabled (C8)
row ~ integrations/bunorm/v4/audit.FileStorage.Save#1 ~ H-5: a FileMode field per writer, the audit file storage with the other writers (C5)
