row ~ integrations/cron/v4.RunnerCommand.Run ~ W-3: a cron User under the in-process runner refused, door RunnerConfig.EntryUserIgnored (C8)
row ~ integrations/cron/v4.TickDedupConfig ~ Q-2 / G3R-3: the dedup over a locker without a lease is an open decision of the owner
row ~ integrations/cron/v4.createTheLogsRoot#1 ~ H-5: a DirectoryMode field per writer, the cron logs root with the other writers (C5)
row ~ integrations/cron/v4.resolveEntryLogPath#1 ~ H-5: a DirectoryMode field per writer, the cron logs root with the other writers (C5)
row ~ security.csrfDisabledOnLoginFirewall ~ M-6: one ignore key for both process shapes, the cli keys retired (C6)
row ~ v4/application.Application.bootCli ~ M-7: ApplicationConfig.DebugCommandsEnabled (C6)
